#. type: Title =
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combat at a Glance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Interlinked units form a single combat engagement. Work out results for each "
"engagement separately."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:14
msgid "Total the Attack value for each unit."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:15
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:19
msgid "Roll the number of dice indicated."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:16
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:20
msgid "Rolls of 4+ score hits."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:17
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:22
msgid "Rolls of 5+ are needed to score hits on a defended target."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:18
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:24
msgid "Rolls of 6+ are needed to score hits on a fortified target."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:19
msgid "Make Armour rolls and discount saved hits."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:20
msgid "Record hits scored."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:21
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:27
msgid "Remove stands where sufficient hits are scored."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Results"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:26
msgid "Compare the hits scored by each side."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:27
msgid "Add +1 per supporting stand."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "3+^a|"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Draw!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:39
msgid ""
"|Both sides score the same hits.  |Both sides fall back from zero cm (but at "
"least 1cm from the enemy) to 3D6cm except for defended or fortified units.  |"
"Combat ends."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "4+^a|"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Win!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:49
msgid ""
"|One side scores more hits.  |Losers retreat by the difference (divided by "
"number of units in multiple combats rounded up).  |Winners fall back, stand "
"or pursue/advance.  |If winners fall back or stand, the combat ends."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "2+^a|"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Aftermath!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:56
msgid ""
"|If winner pursues in the first round, fight a second round.  |If winner "
"pursues in the second round, leave the combat unresolved."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pursuit / Advance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Infantry [.bo5a]#cannot# pursue retreating cavalry or chariots unless "
"infantry charged their flank or rear or the charged unit is in irregular "
"formation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:64
msgid "Artillery never pursue. If forced to retreat they are destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:65
msgid "Fortified troops never pursue."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:66
msgid "Victors cannot pursue into terrain they cannot enter or cross."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:67
msgid "Advancing units charge nearest visible enemy unit within 20cm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:68
msgid ""
"[.bo5a]#All pursuing, advancing or retreating units lose defended or "
"fortified status.#"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "End of combat"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/combat-at-a-glance.adoc:78
msgid ""
"At the end of the Combat phase, any odd hits are discounted from units that "
"are no longer engaged."
msgstr ""
